• inform Siad that continued Somali
                    assistance for the Ogaden insurgents will have an adverse impact on favorable
                    Congressional consideration of assistance to Somalia;

• we will tell Siad that we are prepared
                    to help meet his legitimate defense needs but no offer of a specific military
                    package or level will be made;

• State will consult with the French tomorrow on how best to maintain Djibouti’s
                    integrity. If asked, Moose may discuss
                    Djibouti with Siad;
